{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"五年春王正月，王使榮叔歸含，且賵。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"三月辛亥，葬我小君成風。王使召伯來會葬。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"夏，公孫敖如晉。秦人入鄀。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"秋，楚人滅六。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"冬，十月甲申，許男業卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"五年春，王使榮叔來含且賵，召昭公來會葬，禮也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"初，鄀叛楚即秦，又貳於楚。夏，秦人入鄀。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"六人叛楚，即東夷。秋，楚成大心、仲歸帥師滅六。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"冬，楚公子燮滅蓼，臧文仲聞六與蓼滅，曰：「臯陶庭堅不祀忽諸。德之不建，民之無援，哀哉！」","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"晉陽處父聘于衛，反過甯，甯嬴從之，及溫而還。其妻問之，嬴曰；「以剛。《商書》曰：『沈漸剛克，高明柔克。』夫子壹之，其不沒乎。天為剛德，猶不干時，況在人乎？且華而不實，怨之所聚也。犯而聚怨，不可以定身。余懼不獲其，而離其難，是以去之。」","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_101_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_101","textTraditional":"晉趙成子，欒貞子、霍伯、臼季皆卒。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}